# ML pipeline

- `ml/` does not import FastAPI, HTTP clients, or React.
- Fit models on normal images only. Read anomalous images and masks in evaluation code.
- Choose thresholds from the validation split. Do not peek at the official test split to set them.
- Document tensor layout, spatial size, normalization, and map range on every public model function.
- Reconstruction error and feature distance are different quantities. Do not mix their scales without a written calibration.
- Training writes checkpoints outside Git. Record seed, config, and library versions beside the artifact.
- Raise `NotImplementedError` until the owning wave implements the function. Do not return fake metrics.
